{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30261","headline":"奉和仆射相公送东川李支使归使府夏侯相公 · 薛逢","name":"奉和仆射相公送东川李支使归使府夏侯相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"两地交通布政和，上台深喜使星过。\n欢留白日千钟酒，调入青云一曲歌。\n寒柳翠添微雨重，腊梅香绽细枝多。\n平津万一言卑散，莫忘高松寄女萝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30261.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30261","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}